sha-mbles-1.bin — provenance and license notice
================================================

File:      sha-mbles-1.bin (640 bytes)
SHA-1:     8ac60ba76f1999a1ab70223f225aefdc78d4ddc0 (byte-identical to the
           upstream copy below)
Source:    the `test/sha-mbles-1.bin` file shipped in the crates.io package
           `sha1collisiondetection` 0.3.4
           (repository: https://gitlab.com/sequoia-pgp/sha1collisiondetection),
           copied unmodified.
Content:   one half of the "SHA-1 is a Shambles" chosen-prefix collision
           (G. Leurent and T. Peyrin, 2020), used upstream as a test vector.
Use here:  test-only input for sandpane-core `objects.rs`
           (`a_sha1_collision_attack_is_refused_not_hashed`); never shipped in a
           release artifact.

